   177	selected Bitcoin block was mined, because that block commits to their SHA-256 hash (under the registered
   178	cryptographic and chain assumptions). T is that block's header time, a chain-time value. It is not an upper bound
   179	in UTC: A2.1 registers no finite bound on B − C, and neither ε nor S is one. A UTC reading needs the additional
   180	backward-skew assumption that V1 does not establish. A10.1.1 recommends one such assumption, for a separate
   181	assessment only; this section does not depend on it.
