    11	## 1. What A-UTC says and what would falsify it
    12	
    13	**Notation (memo).** h* is the selected inclusion height of the receipt proof (confirmation one); h*+5 is
    14	confirmation six. r(j) is the real (UTC) time at which block j was first produced. nTime(j) is its header time.
