   287	## A10.2 The window establishes two comparisons, not issuance "inside" it — OWNER DECISION, NARROW-CLAIM (review A02)
   288	
   289	A9's opening says the keys "were allowed to issue during a stated window" (:36), and guarantee 2's heading says
