    16	## Summary
    17	
    18	- **UTC bound: adopt U1.** V1 reports `U = max nTime(h* … h*+5) + 7200 s` in an assessment wrapper, outside the six
    19	  stable fields. The accompanying claim is that the bytes and both signatures existed before U (UTC).
    20	  - U rests on one new, named assumption, A-UTC. A-UTC is not consensus.
    21	  - U uses only headers that V1 already requires and pins.
    22	  - RFC 3161 tokens (U2) are recorded as a candidate, not as a V2 obligation.
