  1415	and JCS with no JSON numbers; binary values are canonical base64 (section 15.1); times use the `utc` grammar of
  1416	section 10; decimal strings are canonical unsigned decimals (`0|[1-9][0-9]*`) with per-field ranges: `version` 1 to
